{
    "title": "Headout: Travel Experiences",
    "description": "Imagine all the fun things you can do in a city in a single day.\r\nNow, imagine booking them instantly with a single tap.\r\nThat's Headout.\r\n\r\nA spontaneous-kind-of-an-app that gets you to experience exciting live shows, action-packed activities, and fascinating tours around you.\r\nA thoughtful-kind-of-an-app that gets you the best last-minute availability and great discounts.\r\nIt's the best-kind-of-an-app for everyone and everything fun.\r\n\r\nDownload the app and head out to\r\n\u2022 Unforgettable award-winning musicals on Broadway\r\n\u2022 Exhilarating helicopter tours of the Grand Canyon\r\n\u2022 Cruise the waters of the San Francisco Bay on a rocket boat\r\n\u2022 Deep sea fishing adventures at the Arabian Gulf in Dubai\r\nThese are just 4 of the 4000+ hand-picked experiences that you can browse and book on Headout in New York, Las Vegas, San Francisco, Los Angeles, Orlando, Hawaii, Dubai, Abu Dhabi, London & Paris.\r\n\r\nDiscover. Book. Headout.\r\n\r\nIf this is your kind-of-an-app, we would love to hear from you on\r\nTwitter - @headout\r\nFacebook - /headoutapp\r\nEmail - hi@headout.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Imagine all the fun things you can do in a city in a single day.<br>Now, imagine booking them instantly with a single tap.<br>That&#39;s Headout.<br><br>A spontaneous-kind-of-an-app that gets you to experience exciting live shows, action-packed activities, and fascinating tours around you.<br>A thoughtful-kind-of-an-app that gets you the best last-minute availability and great discounts.<br>It&#39;s the best-kind-of-an-app for everyone and everything fun.<br><br>Download the app and head out to<br>\u2022 Unforgettable award-winning musicals on Broadway<br>\u2022 Exhilarating helicopter tours of the Grand Canyon<br>\u2022 Cruise the waters of the San Francisco Bay on a rocket boat<br>\u2022 Deep sea fishing adventures at the Arabian Gulf in Dubai<br>These are just 4 of the 4000+ hand-picked experiences that you can browse and book on Headout in New York, Las Vegas, San Francisco, Los Angeles, Orlando, Hawaii, Dubai, Abu Dhabi, London &amp; Paris.<br><br>Discover. Book. Headout.<br><br>If this is your kind-of-an-app, we would love to hear from you on<br>Twitter - @headout<br>Facebook - /headoutapp<br>Email - hi@headout.com",
